+## Ledger provenance and local verification
+
+**Counts at this revision: 29 VERIFIED / 103 PARTIAL / 6 OPEN = 138**, recomputed from the table rows on 2026-11-01 (the five most recent VERIFIED promotions are #135, #81, #85, #130 and #136). The separate 150-point Advanced Provider Store acceptance ledger lives only on the PR #84 branch; that branch's copy of *this* 138-item ledger is an older snapshot (24 VERIFIED / 95 PARTIAL / 19 OPEN) and differs from this file in 17 rows.
+
+**Local verification 2026-11-01 (not CI; Python 3.12.3, run via `python -m projects.provider_store.task25_test_report`):** 650 tests, `OK (skipped=1)` (the skip is the opt-in real-Ollama test), plus `compileall` and provider JSON catalog validation. GitHub Actions has not yet run on this change; run [#40525243664](https://github.com/attaehmad5-lang/AI_CREATOR_AGENT/actions/runs/40525243664) (633 tests) remains the latest CI evidence. No status was changed by this revision.
+
 **Status meanings:** `VERIFIED` = code and relevant regression tests cover the stated item; `PARTIAL` = useful implementation/tests exist but the complete original requirement or live integration is missing; `OPEN` = no adequate implementation/evidence yet.
